Date: Thu, 5 Nov 2026 19:13:22 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] Add the widget extension target and App Group

- New target ToBeDoneWidgetExtension (iOS 18.2+, iPhone and iPad) built from
  the ToBeDoneWidget folder and embedded in the app (iOS only, not Mac/visionOS)
- App Group group.ro.vishrama.tobedone for the app (iOS builds) and the widget,
  so the widget can read today's items

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01Gr2WsQESLKfCjr7H1bpNwj
